\frametitle{Workflow \& Tooling}
\small
    \textbf{Development environment:}
    WSL2 Linux filesystem, VS Code with WSL extension,
    Docker Desktop with WSL2 backend, Chrome for testing.

    \vspace{0.3em}
    \textbf{Makefile targets:}
    \vspace{0.1em}

    \begin{table}
    \centering
    \small
    \begin{tabular}{ll}
        \toprule
        \textbf{Command} & \textbf{Purpose} \\
        \midrule
        \texttt{make dev}       & Start API container + frontend dev server \\
        \texttt{make build}     & Build the API Docker image \\
        \texttt{make test}      & Run all tests (pytest + vitest) \\
        \texttt{make gpu-check} & Verify GPU/Docker readiness \\
        \bottomrule
    \end{tabular}
    \end{table}

    \vspace{0.3em}
    \textbf{Smoke test} (fastest full-stack feedback loop):
    \begin{lstlisting}[language=bash]
bash ops/scripts/smoke_test.sh ops/scripts/test.mp3
    \end{lstlisting}
    Tests \texttt{GET /health} and \texttt{POST /transcribe} against the
    running API with a real audio file.
